    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22935000?u=f1dc6eb84e6d89bd981513343484aff797908b42&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40031.\">Resolves</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3166285013\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40031\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40031/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40031\">#40031</a><br>\nMore context on this issue ^<br>\ntl;dr:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The very first paragraph states</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">JavaScript is a <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Prototype-based_programming\" rel=\"nofollow\">prototype-based</a>, multi-paradigm, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Thread\" rel=\"nofollow\">single-threaded</a>, <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Dynamic_typing\" rel=\"nofollow\">dynamic</a> language</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">but JS being described as single-threaded has become pretty misleading.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>If you click on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/Thread\" rel=\"nofollow\">single-threaded</a>, you're directed to a page that states</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">\"Modern <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Glossary/JavaScript\" rel=\"nofollow\">JavaScript</a> offers ways to create additional threads, each executing independently while possibly communicating between one another.\"</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">which is a bit conflicting</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>No modern day JS engine is actually single threaded anymore</li>\n<li>The language spec itself makes no claim about single-threadedness</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Communicated with <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/NekoNyanners/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/NekoNyanners\">@NekoNyanners</a><br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40031#issuecomment-2996492365\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40031/hovercard\">Approved</a> by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Josh-Cena/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Josh-Cena\">@Josh-Cena</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40047",
