        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">As part of a larger project to make the challenges/reader exercises in MDN learn more consistent, this PR:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Removes \"Active learning\" wording.</li>\n<li>Replaces the old code editors with the live sample + MDN Playground flow.</li>\n<li>Makes some general wording improvements, and removes some unnecessary sections.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
