        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>additions:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Dedicated page for the <code class=\"notranslate\">http-equiv</code> attr.</li>\n<li>Sidebar entry</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Changes:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>updates links from the DL <code class=\"notranslate\">meta#http-equiv</code> to the page instead: <code class=\"notranslate\">meta/http-equiv</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There's a lot to say for this, there's too much info in the single DL, it warrants a separate page, exposing compat data.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3120751039\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39804\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/39804/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/39804\">#39804</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40043",
            "title": "feat(html): Add meta http-equiv attr page",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-23T10:59:09.000Z",
