        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF141 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/IntersectionObserver\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">IntersectionObserver.scrollMargin</code></a> in <a href=\"https://https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1860030\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1860030</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds documentation for that property, and also for the <code class=\"notranslate\">delay</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">trackVisibility</code> properties that now have implementations in some browsers.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Note that this is draft because I'm still getting my head around it. May need additional BCD work. Will need guide work</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3166061590\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40026\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40026/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40026\">#40026</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40040",
