        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF141 adds support for <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLDialogElement/closedBy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">HTMLDialogElement.closedBy</code></a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/dialog#closedby\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"notranslate\">closedby</code> attribute on <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;dialog&gt;</code></a> by default in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1964078\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1964078</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This adds a release note and removes the experimental feature note.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3166062421\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40028\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40028/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40028\">#40028</a></p>",
