        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/432915?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/6c878f4c9349c46e2c6f03a8c9bf4a5b07836193/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/6c878f4c9349c46e2c6f03a8c9bf4a5b07836193\"><tt>6c878f4</tt></a> adds a new glossary page on UTF-16, and <span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #39946.\">fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3147379489\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39946\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/39946/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/39946\">#39946</a>.</li>\n<li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/fc70128cf553c10d1e8089a28f55cb372286ea65/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/fc70128cf553c10d1e8089a28f55cb372286ea65\"><tt>fc70128</tt></a> deletes a lot of the \"code units\" page as it was really about UTF-16, which is now covered in the new page</li>\n<li><a class=\"commit-link\" data-hovercard-type=\"commit\" data-hovercard-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/5ae51e954fdda9fbb1d3a30bcbeb66daf458abf3/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/commit/5ae51e954fdda9fbb1d3a30bcbeb66daf458abf3\"><tt>5ae51e9</tt></a> links to the new glossary page from various places, and fixes a couple of related errors here and there.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I didn't add/update links from the JS docs because they also have <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/String#utf-16_characters_unicode_code_points_and_grapheme_clusters\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/JavaScript/Reference/Global_Objects/String#utf-16_characters_unicode_code_points_and_grapheme_clusters</a>, which they point to sometimes, and I didn't know if they want to point there instead.</p>",
